---
import Workspace from '../layouts/Workspace.astro';
---
<Workspace title="Editor" section="editor" module="02">
<section class="title"><div><p class="eyebrow">SEU CONTEÚDO. SEU ENQUADRAMENTO.</p><h1>Editor<span>.</span></h1><p>Selecione a área da imagem. O vídeo continua inteiro.</p></div><a href="#templates" class="download-all">Templates ↓</a></section>
<div id="creative-context" class="creative-context" hidden><p id="creative-context-text"></p><a href="/criativos" class="ui-button secondary">Voltar aos criativos</a></div>
<p id="message" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
<div class="editor-grid">
<section class="panel stage"><label class="source-label">Vídeo do acervo<select id="source"><option>Carregando acervo…</option></select></label>
<div class="canvas-wrap"><div id="frame"><video id="preview" playsinline preload="metadata"></video><div id="overlay" aria-label="Área de seleção"><div id="selection" tabindex="0" aria-label="Mover seleção com as setas"><span class="selection-tag">ÁREA SELECIONADA</span><i data-handle="nw"></i><i data-handle="ne"></i><i data-handle="sw"></i><i data-handle="se"></i></div></div></div></div>
<div class="playback"><button id="play" class="secondary">▶ Reproduzir</button><input id="seek" aria-label="Posição no vídeo" type="range" min="0" max="100" step="0.01" value="0"/><span id="time">—</span></div>
<p class="guide">Arraste fora da seleção para desenhar uma nova área. Mova o retângulo ou puxe os cantos para ajustar.</p>
<div class="stage-footer"><span id="source-meta">—</span><button id="reset" class="text-button">Usar imagem inteira</button></div></section>
<section class="panel settings"><p class="eyebrow">ENQUADRAMENTO</p><h2>Só o que interessa.</h2><p class="muted-copy">A área selecionada será mantida do primeiro ao último quadro.</p>
<form id="crop-form"><label>Nome da exportação<input id="title" maxlength="100" required/></label><div class="measurements">
<label>Esquerda (px)<input id="x" type="number" min="0" step="2" required/></label><label>Topo (px)<input id="y" type="number" min="0" step="2" required/></label><label>Largura (px)<input id="width" type="number" min="2" step="2" required/></label><label>Altura (px)<input id="height" type="number" min="2" step="2" required/></label></div>
<div class="preset"><label>Predefinição de recorte<select id="presets"><option value="">Escolha um modelo salvo</option></select></label><div class="preset-actions"><button id="apply-preset" type="button" class="secondary">Aplicar</button><button id="save-preset" type="button" class="secondary">Salvar seleção</button></div><small>Usa o nome acima. Salvo neste navegador, em proporção à imagem. Confira ao aplicar em outro vídeo.</small></div>
<label class="check"><input id="muted" type="checkbox"/> Exportar sem áudio</label><div class="result"><span>PRÉVIA DA ÁREA</span><canvas id="result-preview"></canvas><p id="output-meta">—</p></div>
<button id="export" type="submit" disabled>Exportar vídeo ↗</button><button id="apply-others-crop" type="button" class="secondary" disabled style="width:100%;margin-top:12px">Aplicar a outros vídeos</button><p class="muted-copy">O original fica preservado. Para usar sua arte, escolha um template na etapa abaixo.</p></form></section></div>
<section class="template-section" id="templates"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">02 · SUA IDENTIDADE VISUAL</p><h2>Templates de composição</h2><p class="muted-copy">Envie sua arte, marque o espaço do vídeo e reutilize nos próximos conteúdos.</p></div></div>
<div class="template-grid"><div class="panel template-preview"><label class="source-label">Template<select id="template-picker"><option value="">Sem template — exportar só o recorte</option></select></label><div id="no-template"><p>Seu vídeo dentro da sua arte.</p><span>Envie um PNG, JPG ou WebP para começar.</span></div><div id="template-stage" hidden><div class="composition-frame"><canvas id="composition" width="540" height="960"></canvas><div id="slot-overlay"><div id="slot-box" tabindex="0" aria-label="Mover espaço do vídeo com as setas"><span>VÍDEO</span><i data-corner="nw"></i><i data-corner="ne"></i><i data-corner="sw"></i><i data-corner="se"></i></div></div></div><div class="composition-actions"><button id="composition-play" class="secondary">▶ Reproduzir / pausar</button><button id="apply-others" class="secondary" disabled>Aplicar a outros vídeos</button><button id="export-composition" disabled>Exportar composição ↗</button></div><p class="guide">Arraste para posicionar o vídeo. Ajuste os cantos ou desenhe uma nova área sobre a arte.</p></div></div>
<div class="panel template-settings"><form id="upload-template"><h3>Adicionar uma arte</h3><label>Nome do template<input name="name" maxlength="100" placeholder="Ex.: TV retrô"/></label><label>Imagem<input id="template-file" name="image" type="file" accept="image/png,image/jpeg,image/webp" required/></label><button id="upload-template-button" type="submit" class="secondary">↑ Importar arte</button><p class="muted-copy">Até 20 MB. Composição vertical 1080 × 1920. A arte é ajustada sem distorção, com margens quando necessário.</p></form>
<div id="template-controls" hidden><label>Nome salvo<input id="template-name" maxlength="100"/></label><div class="measurements"><label>Esquerda (px)<input id="slot-x" type="number" step="2" min="0"/></label><label>Topo (px)<input id="slot-y" type="number" step="2" min="0"/></label><label>Largura (px)<input id="slot-slot_w" type="number" step="2" min="2"/></label><label>Altura (px)<input id="slot-slot_h" type="number" step="2" min="2"/></label></div><label>Camadas<select id="template-layer"><option value="behind">Arte por cima · vídeo por trás</option><option value="front">Vídeo por cima · arte ao fundo</option></select></label><label>Encaixe<select id="template-fit"><option value="cover">Preencher — corta as sobras</option><option value="contain">Mostrar tudo — adiciona margens pretas</option></select></label><p class="muted-copy">Com a arte por cima, o vídeo aparece pelas partes transparentes do PNG. Você pode aumentar o vídeo sem cobrir a moldura.</p><button id="save-template" type="button">Salvar template</button></div><p id="template-message" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></div></div></section>

<section class="exports"><div class="section-heading"><h2>Histórico de exportações</h2><a class="ui-button secondary" href="/criativos">Revisar criativos ↗</a></div><div id="exports-list"></div></section>
<dialog id="result-dialog"><div class="dialog-heading"><h2 id="result-title">Vídeo exportado</h2><button id="close-result" class="secondary">Fechar</button></div><video id="result-video" controls playsinline></video><a id="result-download" class="download-all">↓ Baixar vídeo</a></dialog>
<dialog id="batch-dialog"><div class="dialog-heading"><h2>Aplicar a outros vídeos</h2><button id="batch-close" class="secondary">Fechar</button></div><p class="muted-copy">O recorte será adaptado proporcionalmente. Confira as prévias: a posição do gameplay pode mudar entre vídeos.</p><div class="batch-toolbar"><label>Nome do lote<input id="batch-name" maxlength="100"/></label><label>Perfil<select id="batch-profile"></select></label><button id="batch-all" class="secondary">Selecionar todos do filtro</button><button id="batch-none" class="secondary">Desmarcar filtro</button></div><p id="batch-message" role="status"></p><div id="batch-previews"></div><div class="batch-footer"><button id="batch-prev" class="secondary">← Anterior</button><span id="batch-page"></span><button id="batch-next" class="secondary">Próxima →</button><strong id="batch-count"></strong><button id="batch-confirm" disabled>Gerar criativos</button></div></dialog>

<script>import '../scripts/editor.ts';</script>
<style>
.editor-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 330px;gap:24px;align-items:start}.panel{border:1px solid #343b45;border-radius:12px;background:#161a20;overflow:hidden}.source-label{display:block;padding:20px;font-size:13px;color:#a9b4c2}.source-label select{display:block;width:100%;margin:10px 0 0}.canvas-wrap{height:480px;background:#090b0e;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:16px}#frame{position:relative;max-width:100%;max-height:100%;line-height:0}#preview{display:block;width:100%;height:100%}#overlay{position:absolute;inset:0;overflow:hidden;touch-action:none;cursor:crosshair}#selection{position:absolute;border:2px solid #c0ef6c;box-shadow:0 0 0 2000px #0009;cursor:move;touch-action:none}.selection-tag{position:absolute;top:8px;left:8px;font-size:9px;line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:1px;background:#10150dcc;color:#ddffab;padding:4px;pointer-events:none;white-space:nowrap}#selection i{position:absolute;width:14px;height:14px;background:#c0ef6c;border:2px solid #111;border-radius:3px}i[data-handle=nw]{top:-2px;left:-2px;cursor:nwse-resize}i[data-handle=ne]{top:-2px;right:-2px;cursor:nesw-resize}i[data-handle=sw]{bottom:-2px;left:-2px;cursor:nesw-resize}i[data-handle=se]{bottom:-2px;right:-2px;cursor:nwse-resize}.playback{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:16px;flex-wrap:wrap}.playback input{width:auto;flex:1;min-width:70px;accent-color:#c0ef6c}.playback span{font-size:12px;color:#aab5c3}.secondary{background:#29313b;color:#dce5ef;padding:10px 13px}.guide{font-size:13px;color:#a0abba;padding:0 20px;line-height:1.7}.stage-footer{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;padding:20px;font-size:12px;color:#9ba7b5;border-top:1px solid #303842}.text-button{background:none;padding:0;color:#c0ef6c;font-size:12px}.settings{padding:24px}.settings h2{font-size:24px}.settings .eyebrow{font-size:10px}.muted-copy{font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:#99a6b7}#crop-form{display:block}#crop-form label{display:block;font-size:12px;color:#b2bdcb;margin-top:18px}#crop-form input:not([type=checkbox]){display:block;background:#0d1116;border:1px solid #3b4655;border-radius:6px;padding:10px;margin-top:8px;width:100%;color:#e8eef5}#crop-form select{width:100%;margin:8px 0 0}.measurements{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:0 12px}.preset{margin:22px 0;padding:0 0 20px;border-block:1px solid #303a46}.preset-actions{display:flex;gap:8px;margin:12px 0}.preset small{font-size:11px;line-height:1.7;color:#8f9eaf;display:block}#crop-form .check{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}input[type=checkbox]{width:17px;height:17px;accent-color:#c0ef6c}.result{margin:24px 0;background:#0b0e12;padding:12px;border-radius:8px}.result>span{font-size:10px;color:#9ca9ba;letter-spacing:1px}.result canvas{display:block;margin:12px auto;max-width:100%;max-height:180px;object-fit:contain}.result p{font-size:12px;color:#c0ef6c;margin-bottom:0}#export{width:100%}#message:not(:empty){padding:14px;background:#26331e;border-radius:8px;font-size:14px}#message.error{background:#3b1e24;color:#ffbdc7}.exports{margin:32px 0}.exports h2{margin-bottom:18px}dialog{width:min(750px,95vw);border:1px solid #46515e;border-radius:12px;background:#171d25;color:#e4ebf4}dialog::backdrop{background:#000b}dialog video{display:block;width:100%;height:60vh;object-fit:contain;margin:18px 0}.dialog-heading{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px}@media(max-width:1050px){.editor-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.canvas-wrap{height:450px}}@media(max-width:500px){.canvas-wrap{height:400px}.settings{padding:18px}.stage-footer{flex-wrap:wrap}}
</style>
<style is:global>.export-row{padding:18px;border:1px solid #343f4c;background:#171d25;border-radius:8px;margin:12px 0;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:15px;flex-wrap:wrap}.export-info{flex:1;min-width:160px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.export-info h3{font-size:15px;margin:0 0 8px}.export-info p{font-size:12px;color:#a6b5c6;margin:0}.export-row button{padding:9px 14px}.export-row a{color:#c0ef6c;font-size:14px}.export-row progress{width:100%;height:5px;accent-color:#c0ef6c}</style>
</Workspace>

<style is:global>
.template-section{margin-top:36px}.template-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 330px;gap:24px;align-items:start}.template-section h2{font-size:24px}.template-preview{background:#10151b}.template-preview .source-label{display:block;padding:20px;font-size:13px;color:#a9b4c2}.template-preview select{display:block;width:100%;margin:10px 0 0}.composition-frame{position:relative;width:min(100%,350px);margin:0 auto;line-height:0}.composition-frame canvas{width:100%;height:auto}#slot-overlay{position:absolute;inset:0;overflow:hidden;touch-action:none;cursor:crosshair}#slot-box{position:absolute;border:2px solid #c0ef6c;cursor:move}#slot-box>span{position:absolute;left:8px;top:8px;color:#dfffab;background:#142008ba;font-size:10px;padding:4px;line-height:1;pointer-events:none}#slot-box i{position:absolute;width:14px;height:14px;background:#c0ef6c;border:2px solid #111;border-radius:3px}i[data-corner=nw]{top:-2px;left:-2px;cursor:nwse-resize}i[data-corner=ne]{top:-2px;right:-2px;cursor:nesw-resize}i[data-corner=sw]{bottom:-2px;left:-2px;cursor:nesw-resize}i[data-corner=se]{bottom:-2px;right:-2px;cursor:nwse-resize}.template-settings{padding:24px}.template-settings form{display:block}.template-settings h3{font-size:18px;margin:0 0 18px}.template-settings label{display:block;font-size:12px;color:#b2bdcb;margin:15px 0}.template-settings input{display:block;background:#0d1116;border:1px solid #3b4655;border-radius:6px;padding:10px;margin-top:8px;width:100%;color:#e8eef5}.template-settings select{width:100%;margin:8px 0 0}.template-settings .measurements{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:0 12px}.template-settings .muted-copy{font-size:12px;color:#99a6b7;line-height:1.7}#template-controls{border-top:1px solid #3a424d;padding-top:12px;margin-top:22px}.composition-actions{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;padding:18px}.template-preview .guide{font-size:12px;color:#9daebe;line-height:1.7;padding:0 20px 10px}#no-template{text-align:center;padding:100px 25px;color:#c6d3e4}#no-template span{font-size:13px;color:#90a0b5}#template-message{font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:#c0ef6c}#template-message.error{color:#ffb5b5}.template-section .panel{border:1px solid #343b45;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden}.template-section .secondary{background:#29313b;color:#dce5ef;padding:10px 13px}@media(max-width:1050px){.template-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>

<style is:global>
#batch-dialog{width:min(1100px,96vw);max-height:94vh;padding:24px;background:#141a22;border:1px solid #485467;border-radius:12px;color:#dce7f5}#batch-dialog::backdrop{background:#000c}#batch-dialog .dialog-heading{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px}#batch-dialog .muted-copy{font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:#a0afc3}.batch-toolbar{display:flex;align-items:end;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:20px 0}.batch-toolbar label{font-size:12px;color:#aebcce;flex:1;min-width:150px}.batch-toolbar input,.batch-toolbar select{display:block;width:100%;margin:8px 0 0;padding:10px;background:#0c1117;border:1px solid #3c495b;border-radius:6px}.batch-toolbar button{padding:11px}.batch-footer{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;position:sticky;bottom:-24px;background:#141a22;padding:18px 0}.batch-footer strong{flex:1;font-size:13px}#batch-previews{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:15px}.batch-preview{display:block;border:1px solid #3e4959;border-radius:9px;padding:12px;cursor:pointer}.batch-preview input{width:17px;height:17px;accent-color:#c0ef6c;padding:0;margin-right:9px}.batch-preview span{font-size:13px}.batch-preview canvas{display:block;width:100%;height:240px;object-fit:contain;background:#090c11;margin:12px 0}.batch-preview small{display:block;color:#a4b3c6;font-size:11px}#batch-message{color:#ffbfbe;font-size:13px}@media(max-width:650px){#batch-previews{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.batch-preview canvas{height:180px}}
</style>

<style is:global>.creative-context{display:flex;gap:18px;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:16px 20px;border:1px solid #5b7140;background:#c0ef6c08;border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:20px}.creative-context p{font-size:13px;max-width:600px;color:#d1ddb9}.creative-context a{flex-shrink:0}@media(max-width:650px){.creative-context{flex-wrap:wrap}}</style>
